The magnitudes of the vectors are calculated using the `length_squared` method of the `Vector2` class and the Pythagorean theorem:
```go
var magnitude_A = Math.sqrt(vector_A.length_squared())
var magnitude_B = Math.sqrt(vector_B.length_squared())
```
The rotational angle is then calculated using the formula above and the dot product and magnitudes of the vectors:
```go
